# The repo copies are LF; the DEPLOYED copies under the Razor Scripts folders
# are CRLF. Keeping that distinction is what makes
#
#     diff --strip-trailing-cr Scripts/harvest_runner.py <deployed copy>
#
# report only real drift. A global core.autocrlf=true would check these out as
# CRLF and make every line read as changed, so pin the line endings here.
* text=auto eol=lf
